@model DualPath.Web.Pages.IndexModel
<div class="wrap"><div class="page-intro"><div class="eyebrow">Plans for your next step</div><h1>Choose your structure.<br><span class="serif">Keep your momentum.</span></h1><p class="lead">Begin with free foundations. Choose independent learning, add guidance, or bring a whole cohort along.</p></div><div class="notice">The final price, currency, tax and billing interval are shown in secure checkout before any payment. @if(!Model.BillingReady){<span>Paid checkout is not open yet. You can still explore the free foundations module.</span>}</div><div class="grid3">@foreach(var plan in new[]{"Independent","Guided","Institution"}){<article class="card price-card @(plan=="Guided"?"featured":"")"><div class="eyebrow">@plan</div><h3>@(plan=="Institution"?"A programme for your people.":plan=="Guided"?"Support for a better next attempt.":"Learn at your own pace.")</h3><p>@(plan=="Institution"?"Cohorts, teaching staff, student seats, and learning reports.":plan=="Guided"?"The full learning path, practical work, and feedback when an instructor is assigned.":"All core modules, assessments, reflections, and your proof portfolio.")</p><div class="divider"></div><div class="check">✓ Structured learning and practical work</div><div class="check">✓ Your progress, saved across sessions</div><div class="check">✓ Clear support and account controls</div><a class="btn @(plan=="Guided"?"":"outline")" href="@(plan=="Institution"?"/schools":"/checkout")">@(plan=="Institution"?"Discuss your programme":"Choose your next step") →</a></article>}</div><section class="section"><h2>Preparation, with clear expectations.</h2><details class="card"><summary>Is an internship guaranteed?</summary><p>DualPath provides preparation, practice, and feedback. Employers make their own hiring decisions.</p></details><details class="card" style="margin-top:15px"><summary>How do I cancel or change a subscription?</summary><p>Use your account’s secure billing portal. You will see the timing and access effects before confirming a change.</p></details></section></div>
